    {
      "id": "fix_agent_edits_refresh_immediately",
      "text": "Implemented fix: agent graph edits refresh immediately\nAgent/server graph edits no longer require manual Reload to appear. Resource event refresh planning now distinguishes local unsaved UI edits from external live-instance dirty state, and clears stale live-instance cache when an authoritative saved resource update should take over.",
      "tags": [
        "bugfix",
        "data",
        "implemented",
        "shell"
      ],
      "layout": {
        "position": {
          "x": 2486,
          "y": 1412
